     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Normal lumbar spine. Colored frontal X-ray showing bones of the lower (lumbar) spine. These bones (block-shaped) are called vertebrae. The base of the ribs (top) and the pelvis (bottom) are also seen.</rdf:li>
